    "summary": "1–2, The Lord’s arm is over all the earth; 3–6, To preach the gospel and save souls is the thing of most worth.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "Revelation given through Joseph Smith the Prophet to Peter Whitmer Jr., at Fayette, New York, June 1829 (see theheading to section 14). Peter Whitmer Jr. later became one of the Eight Witnesses to the Book of Mormon."
      }
